{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粉錦公路發生驚險車禍。今日（24日）上午約8時43分，一輛私家車沿粉錦公路，往上水方向行駛；途至近路德會雙魚薈對開時，突然失控剷上行人路巴士站，據悉3名途人被撞到，包括一名兒童。</p><p>救援人員到場，幸3名傷者均傷勢不嚴重，清醒由救護車分別送往沙田威爾斯醫院及北區醫院治理。警方正調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事巴士站損毀，警員圍封現場。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190607687671353344526139.jpeg/f6xvj4l7PsKJUsn9QX_0eXXFO4LbLLsfY6T3bEak92w\"/><figcaption>涉事巴士站損毀，警員圍封現場。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事巴士站損毀，警員圍封現場。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190608902035607552169453.jpeg/TwOr-7EkRaFsiNBwOYW88XREugB57PoaxsMHUcbDB1E\"/><figcaption>涉事巴士站損毀，警員圍封現場。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"其中兩名傷者被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190605306787270656629417.jpeg/wna0TBbsLNvbA4RqKpc0kfwu08k85at6D4oSOA-KEjg\"/><figcaption>其中兩名傷者被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"其中一名傷者被送往北區醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187576774913953792926350.jpeg/x48gL4O99UrCYRliltn6q366sWC0Y4VIdKGA_06hgP8\"/><figcaption>其中一名傷者被送往北區醫院治理。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:44:13.908431+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:19:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:29.329709+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:29.329709+00:00","content_hash":"9a95f11b5e33a5315aa4c853e40c2ae312845ee1551ca348069955a6d4484390","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}